{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月3日下午，DeepSeek出現對話功能無法使用，聊天界面顯示「伺服器繁忙，請稍後重試」。目前，DeepSeek官網更新狀態稱，此前發生的網頁及API服務部分中斷問題已實施修復，正在監控修復效果。不過，DeepSeek V4 Pro、DeepSeek V4.1 Flash的API服務及對話服務仍存在性能下降的情況。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584884.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:01:25.911715+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:48:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_hash":"bb6306f16bea5f0ce18e8b088656a2f2312d662119f0a2980ea5837d38def3fd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}